

Pwogram jesyon-memwa: 1.

>> x := 0.
>> y := ['Hello'].
>> q := { ['']. }.
>> p := Vre.
>> a := Lis ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 4.
>> c := Objè nouvo.
c lè: ['greet:'] fè: { Sòti ekri: ['greet!']. }.

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.
>> usedMemory5 := 0.

Pwogram netwaye.
>> usedMemory1 := (Pwogram memwa ? 0).




